    <string name="permission_desc_1">Force-stopping apps directly are not possible without system API. Shizuku provides something like being a <b>middle man</b>" to receive requests from the app, send them to the system server, and send back the results.

To install it, please click the "<b>DOWNLOAD</b> button from below.</string>
    <string name="permission_desc_2">"You need to complete the pairing process in the Shizuku app. After that, please start the Shizuku.

For more details, please view the "<b>step-by-step guide</b> in the Shizuku app.</string>
    <string name="permission_desc_3">Please click the <b>REQUEST</b> button below and allow permission for the AppSleep.</string>
    <string name="permission_desc_4">"Congratulations, you are ready to go.

If you are using Shizuku in "<b>wireless debugging</b> mode, please remember to do the same things again if you <b>restart your device</b>.</string>
